---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import Calc from '../components/Calc.astro';
const faq = [
 {
  "q": "Is there an official 8th Pay Commission pay scale chart?",
  "a": "No. The commission has not announced a pay matrix. The scenario columns on this page are multiples of current pay."
 },
 {
  "q": "What is in the PDF?",
  "a": "Entry pay for all 19 levels with scenario columns, and 7th CPC cells 1 to 20 for levels 1 to 14."
 },
 {
  "q": "Is the PDF free?",
  "a": "Yes. It is free to download and share, with the source named."
 },
 {
  "q": "How often is the chart updated?",
  "a": "When the 8th CPC announces a matrix or the Government revises the pay structure. The figures here were last checked on 3 November 2026."
 }
];
const toc = [{"id": "download", "label": "Download the PDF"}, {"id": "table", "label": "Entry pay by level with scenarios"}, {"id": "use", "label": "How to read the chart"}, {"id": "faq", "label": "FAQ"}];
const related = ["8th-pay-commission-pay-matrix", "fitment-factor-8th-pay-commission", "7th-vs-8th-pay-commission", "8th-pay-commission-salary-calculator"];
---

<SiteLayout title="8th Pay Commission Pay Scale Chart PDF: Free Download" description="Download a free 8th Pay Commission pay scale chart PDF: 7th CPC pay matrix by level and cell, with scenario columns at 1.92 to 3.83 fitment." slug="8th-pay-commission-pay-scale-chart-pdf" h1="8th Pay Commission Pay Scale Chart PDF" lead="A free three-page PDF of the 7th CPC pay matrix with illustrative 8th CPC scenario columns, plus the same figures on this page." faq={faq} toc={toc} related={related} pageType="article" breadcrumbLabel="Pay Scale Chart PDF">

<div class="answer"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> The 8th Pay Commission has not published a pay scale chart. This page offers a free PDF of the current 7th CPC pay matrix (levels 1 to 14, cells 1 to 20) and entry pay for all 19 levels with scenario columns for 8th CPC fitment of 1.92 to 3.83. The scenario columns are illustrative, not official.</p></div>

<h2 id="download">Download the PDF</h2>
<p><a class="btn" href="/downloads/8th-pay-commission-pay-scale-chart.pdf" download>Download pay scale chart (PDF, 3 pages)</a></p><Figure name="pay-matrix-chart-preview" /><ul><li><strong>Page 1.</strong> Entry pay of all 19 levels with scenario columns.</li><li><strong>Page 2.</strong> Levels 1 to 9, cells 1 to 20.</li><li><strong>Page 3.</strong> Levels 10 to 14, cells 1 to 20.</li></ul>

<h2 id="table">Entry pay by level with scenarios</h2>
<p>The same entry-pay table as page 1 of the PDF, so you can read it without downloading anything.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th class="num">7th CPC entry pay</th><th class="num">At 1.92</th><th class="num">At 2.28</th><th class="num">At 2.57</th><th class="num">At 2.86</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Level 1</th><td class="num">₹18,000</td><td class="num">₹34,600</td><td class="num">₹41,000</td><td class="num">₹46,300</td><td class="num">₹51,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 2</th><td class="num">₹19,900</td><td class="num">₹38,200</td><td class="num">₹45,400</td><td class="num">₹51,100</td><td class="num">₹56,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 3</th><td class="num">₹21,700</td><td class="num">₹41,700</td><td class="num">₹49,500</td><td class="num">₹55,800</td><td class="num">₹62,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 4</th><td class="num">₹25,500</td><td class="num">₹49,000</td><td class="num">₹58,100</td><td class="num">₹65,500</td><td class="num">₹72,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 5</th><td class="num">₹29,200</td><td class="num">₹56,100</td><td class="num">₹66,600</td><td class="num">₹75,000</td><td class="num">₹83,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 6</th><td class="num">₹35,400</td><td class="num">₹68,000</td><td class="num">₹80,700</td><td class="num">₹91,000</td><td class="num">₹1,01,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 7</th><td class="num">₹44,900</td><td class="num">₹86,200</td><td class="num">₹1,02,400</td><td class="num">₹1,15,400</td><td class="num">₹1,28,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 8</th><td class="num">₹47,600</td><td class="num">₹91,400</td><td class="num">₹1,08,500</td><td class="num">₹1,22,300</td><td class="num">₹1,36,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 9</th><td class="num">₹53,100</td><td class="num">₹1,02,000</td><td class="num">₹1,21,100</td><td class="num">₹1,36,500</td><td class="num">₹1,51,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 10</th><td class="num">₹56,100</td><td class="num">₹1,07,700</td><td class="num">₹1,27,900</td><td class="num">₹1,44,200</td><td class="num">₹1,60,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 11</th><td class="num">₹67,700</td><td class="num">₹1,30,000</td><td class="num">₹1,54,400</td><td class="num">₹1,74,000</td><td class="num">₹1,93,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 12</th><td class="num">₹78,800</td><td class="num">₹1,51,300</td><td class="num">₹1,79,700</td><td class="num">₹2,02,500</td><td class="num">₹2,25,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 13</th><td class="num">₹1,23,100</td><td class="num">₹2,36,400</td><td class="num">₹2,80,700</td><td class="num">₹3,16,400</td><td class="num">₹3,52,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 13A</th><td class="num">₹1,31,100</td><td class="num">₹2,51,700</td><td class="num">₹2,98,900</td><td class="num">₹3,36,900</td><td class="num">₹3,74,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 14</th><td class="num">₹1,44,200</td><td class="num">₹2,76,900</td><td class="num">₹3,28,800</td><td class="num">₹3,70,600</td><td class="num">₹4,12,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 15</th><td class="num">₹1,82,200</td><td class="num">₹3,49,800</td><td class="num">₹4,15,400</td><td class="num">₹4,68,300</td><td class="num">₹5,21,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 16</th><td class="num">₹2,05,400</td><td class="num">₹3,94,400</td><td class="num">₹4,68,300</td><td class="num">₹5,27,900</td><td class="num">₹5,87,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 17</th><td class="num">₹2,25,000</td><td class="num">₹4,32,000</td><td class="num">₹5,13,000</td><td class="num">₹5,78,300</td><td class="num">₹6,43,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Level 18</th><td class="num">₹2,50,000</td><td class="num">₹4,80,000</td><td class="num">₹5,70,000</td><td class="num">₹6,42,500</td><td class="num">₹7,15,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<h2 id="use">How to read the chart</h2>
<ul><li><strong>7th CPC columns</strong> are the pay structure in force today.</li><li><strong>Scenario columns</strong> multiply entry pay by an assumed fitment factor and round to the nearest Rs 100. They are not an official 8th CPC pay matrix.</li><li><strong>Cells</strong> follow the 3% rule, each rounded to the nearest Rs 100. Confirm any cell against the official matrix before relying on it.</li></ul><p>For one level in detail see the salary by level pages, for example <a href="/8th-pay-commission-level-6-salary/">Level 6</a> or <a href="/8th-pay-commission-level-7-salary/">Level 7</a>. For a cell lookup use the <a href="/8th-pay-commission-pay-matrix/">pay matrix</a> page.</p>

</SiteLayout>
